  "title": "Early Years' Visual Art (2-4yrs)",
  "summary": "Early Years' Visual Art (2-4yrs)",
  "description": "Register Here Starting December 8! Registration for all Aurora Cultural Centre programs is on the Town of Aurora’s e-PLAY website. All programs continue to be part of the Aurora Cultural Centre. January 13 – February 24, 2026 Tuesdays | 10:00 – 11:00 am | Ages 2-4 Aurora Town Square – Multipurpose Studio 50 Victoria Street, Aurora Spark creativity in your 2-4-year-old with this interactive visual art program! Through fun activities, they’ll explore colors, shapes, textures, and expressing themselves visually. Parents can join in for a meaningful bonding experience and learn easy techniques to try at home. All materials are safe and non-toxic. All materials are included!",
